{"names":["Eileen","Michael"],"setting":"You and Michael are next-door neighbours on the same road in Galway, and you have known each other for years through the street and the shared garden wall. Lately you have been trading small favours, like swapping spare plant cuttings and keeping an eye on each other's bins on collection mornings.","openers":["Ask if Michael got the garden wall fixed","Send a photo of the hedge you trimmed","Mention the bin that blew over on Tuesday","Offer to drop round some scones"],"opener":"Offer to drop round some scones","cast":{"Eileen":{"who":"74, woman, a neighbour","work":"retired primary school teacher","knows":"You know Michael as your next-door neighbour, from years of chatting over the garden wall.","texts":"","style":"few emoji, almost no texting abbreviations","emojiKeep":0.6,"capitals":true,"lives":[],"ex":[]},"Michael":{"who":"71, man, a neighbour","work":"retired electrician","knows":"You know Eileen as your next-door neighbour, from many years of sharing the street and the garden wall.","texts":"","style":"few emoji, almost no texting abbreviations","emojiKeep":0.15,"capitals":true,"lives":[],"ex":[]}},"private_lines":{"Eileen":"You live in Galway in a house on the road, your days are filled with retirement after many years as a primary school teacher, and you live on your own.","Michael":"You live in Galway in a house on the road, your days are filled with retirement after a long career as an electrician, and you live on your own."},"usage":[{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":893,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":658},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":893,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral