{"who":"Eileen","text":"Made too many scones. Want some? I can drop them round after 6","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T16:05","checkin":"2026-12-09T16:05"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Go on so. Haven't eaten since lunch","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T16:19","checkin":"2026-12-09T16:19"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Plain or sultana","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T16:21","checkin":"2026-12-09T16:21"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Sultana. Are the bins out already or is it tomorrow","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T16:22","checkin":"2026-12-09T16:22"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Tomorrow. Brown one first, blue is Friday","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T16:24","checkin":"2026-12-09T16:24"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Right. I'll put the green out myself","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T16:25","checkin":"2026-12-09T16:25"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Did the geranium cutting take? The one I gave you Sunday","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T17:50","checkin":"2026-12-09T17:50"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Think so. Got two little white bits coming at the bottom","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T18:03","checkin":"2026-12-09T18:03"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Good. Keep it out of the window, it'll scorch","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T18:04","checkin":"2026-12-09T18:04"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Dropping them round now. Left the scones on the step in a tin if the door's locked","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T18:31","checkin":"2026-12-09T18:31"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Door's open. Come in","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T18:33","checkin":"2026-12-09T18:33"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Ah I'll leave them in the porch","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T18:33","checkin":"2026-12-09T18:33"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Ok. Tin's in. Thanks for them","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T18:35","checkin":"2026-12-09T18:35"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Is the light in your back shed still going on and off? Mine was flickering Sunday","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T19:12","checkin":"2026-12-09T19:12"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Yeah. Probably the switch, it's loose in the box. Don't touch it till I look","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T19:20","checkin":"2026-12-09T19:20"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Wasn't going to","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T19:21","checkin":"2026-12-09T19:21"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Tomorrow after the bins","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T19:22","checkin":"2026-12-09T19:22"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Had one of the sultana ones with the tea. Very good","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T21:48","checkin":"2026-12-09T21:48"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Plain ones are gone too. Brought them to bed with me","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T21:50","checkin":"2026-12-09T21:50"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Michael","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T21:50","checkin":"2026-12-09T21:50"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Joking. Save a few for the morning","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-09T21:51","checkin":"2026-12-09T21:51"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Brown one's gone. Didn't hear the lorry so it might have been early","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T08:12","checkin":"2026-12-10T08:12"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Took it on time. They're early on this road some weeks","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T08:20","checkin":"2026-12-10T08:20"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Going to look at the switch now. Power off at the board first","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T09:47","checkin":"2026-12-10T09:47"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Good man. Mind yourself","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T09:50","checkin":"2026-12-10T09:50"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Loose screw in the switch. Tightened it. Light's steady","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T10:30","checkin":"2026-12-10T10:30"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Thank you. Did you check the wiring at the back","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T10:31","checkin":"2026-12-10T10:31"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Looked fine. I did this for forty years you know","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T10:33","checkin":"2026-12-10T10:33"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Forty years and it took you a morning to get round to it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T10:40","checkin":"2026-12-10T10:40"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Forty years and you've had a flickering shed light since Sunday","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T10:41","checkin":"2026-12-10T10:41"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Geranium has another little leaf. Going to pot it up tomorrow if it's firm enough","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T15:12","checkin":"2026-12-10T15:12"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Leave it till it's got a good few roots. Don't pull it to check","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T15:40","checkin":"2026-12-10T15:40"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Wouldn't dream of it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T15:41","checkin":"2026-12-10T15:41"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Is the blue bin still on your side or did it go back","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T20:30","checkin":"2026-12-10T20:30"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Went back. It's on the wall where you left it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T20:44","checkin":"2026-12-10T20:44"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Can't sleep. Light's working though","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T23:18","checkin":"2026-12-10T23:18"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Good. Go to bed","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T23:20","checkin":"2026-12-10T23:20"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Going","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-10T23:22","checkin":"2026-12-10T23:22"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Blue bin's out today. Is yours still on the wall or did you bring it back","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T08:41","checkin":"2026-12-11T08:41"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Still on the wall. I'll get it in before the lorry","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T08:52","checkin":"2026-12-11T08:52"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Lorry's usually after ten here","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T08:53","checkin":"2026-12-11T08:53"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Then I'll get it in after ten","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T08:58","checkin":"2026-12-11T08:58"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Geranium's got a good few roots I think. Can see them at the hole in the bottom. Going to pot it up","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T11:04","checkin":"2026-12-11T11:04"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Small pot. Don't go big or it'll sit wet","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T11:09","checkin":"2026-12-11T11:09"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"I've a small one. Do I need compost or just the soil from the bag","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T11:10","checkin":"2026-12-11T11:10"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Bag's fine. Put a bit of grit in the bottom if you have it","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T11:14","checkin":"2026-12-11T11:14"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"I have grit. Only from the bird table","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T11:15","checkin":"2026-12-11T11:15"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"That'll do","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T11:16","checkin":"2026-12-11T11:16"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Lorry was early today. Blue bin's back on the wall, your side this time","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T14:37","checkin":"2026-12-11T14:37"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Right. I'll leave it there till you're in","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T14:40","checkin":"2026-12-11T14:40"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Got it into the pot. Think it held","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T15:30","checkin":"2026-12-11T15:30"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Good. Not in the window","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T16:02","checkin":"2026-12-11T16:02"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"You said that Sunday","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T16:04","checkin":"2026-12-11T16:04"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Still true","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T16:05","checkin":"2026-12-11T16:05"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"It's on the sideboard in the hall. Not the window","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T16:06","checkin":"2026-12-11T16:06"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Light's still steady","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T19:48","checkin":"2026-12-11T19:48"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"Good. Saw it through the gap in the hedge","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T19:50","checkin":"2026-12-11T19:50"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Going to make a cup. Want one","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T21:40","checkin":"2026-12-11T21:40"}
{"who":"Eileen","text":"No thanks. Early one tomorrow. Mind the step, it's wet","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T21:44","checkin":"2026-12-11T21:44"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"I will","posted":true,"at":"2026-12-11T21:45","checkin":"2026-12-11T21:45"}
